OL,3,GNEWSANew GP contract and #40m extra a
OL,4,A'start' but more funding needed, BMA
OL,5,Awarns
OL,6,
OL,7,FA new contract with GPs, accompanied by
OL,8,Fan extra #40m investment, will make it
OL,9,F"easier" to get a doctor's appointment,
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland's health minister has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FRobbie Butler has secured an agreement
OL,14,Fwith GPs more than a year after family
OL,15,Fdoctors withdrew some services in
OL,16,Fprotest over a lack of adequate
OL,17,Ffunding.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
