OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANew GP contract and #40m extra a
OL,4,A'start' but more funding needed, BMA
OL,5,Awarns
OL,6,
OL,7,FDr Frances O'Hagan from the British
OL,8,FMedical Association (BMA) said the #40m
OL,9,Fwould be used to hire more GPs and
OL,10,Freceptionists to increase "capacity" in
OL,11,Fsurgeries.
OL,13,FHowever, she said the investment was
OL,14,Fonly "a start" and was "by no means all
OL,15,Fthat we need" in order to address all
OL,16,Fof the demands that GPs are facing.
